rice: <span class=\\\"a-text-strike\\\"> €8.75 </span> </p> <p id=\\\"pqv-price-vat-message\\\" class=\\\"a-spacing-small\\\"> The prices of products sold on Amazon include VAT. Depending on your delivery address, VAT may vary at the checkout. For more information, click &lt;a href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/-/es/gp/help/customer/display.html?ref_=hp_bc_nav&amp;nodeId=G7MYTK9H5NVW7QVW\\\"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. </p> <p class=\\\"a-text-italic\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-buybox-action\\\" data-pqv-buybox-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-buybox\\\" data-target=\\\"#buybox\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B07SLY4NMK\\\"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p> <p class=\\\"a-text-italic\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-buying-options-action\\\" data-pqv-buying-options-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-buying-options\\\" data-target=\\\"#dynamic-aod-ingress-box\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal aok-hidden\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B07SLY4NMK\\\"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class=\\\"a-text-italic\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-unqualified-buybox-action\\\" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-unqualified-buybox\\\" data-target=\\\"#unqualifiedBuyBox\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal aok-hidden\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B07SLY4NMK\\\"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> </div> <div id=\\\"pqv-feature-bullets\\\" data-target=\\\"#featurebullets_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-feature-bullets-heading\\\">About this Item</h2> <ul class=\\\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\\\"> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">Erasable heat-sensitive ink Pilot FriXion Fineliner marker; Thanks to the indestructible eraser cover, this marker pen allows you to erase whatever you want without leaving the slightest trace or crumpling the paper</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">A comfortable marker, available in blue and erasable, the FriXion Fineliner has a minimalist and elegant design, equipped with a clip that attaches to all documents and notebooks; The elongated body ensures a pleasant grip</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">The Pilot FriXion Fineliner marker is suitable for all daily, school, and creative uses; writing, coloring, drawing, organizing a diary, whatever it is, unleash your creativity, and erase what you don't like</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">The pen's durable eraser cap raises the temperature of the ink on paper to completely eliminate it; that's why we do not recommend the use of this erasable marker on official documents</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">Quick and effortless erasable ink: erase a word, line, or paragraph and rewrite it immediately; Clearer writing without draft marks, cleaner work, and significant time optimization</span></li> </ul> </div> <div id=\\\"pqv-description\\\" data-target=\\\"#productDescription_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-description-heading\\\">Product description</h2> <div> Ultra practical 2-in-1 fine point erasable marker. Write, draw, sketch, diagrams, maps, graphs, coloring… Whatever it is, the FriXion Fineliner pen is suitable for everyday tasks and the most creative jobs. In addition, it allows you to change your mind and make modifications, because it is an erasable marker. This eraser pen allows you to effortlessly erase a letter, line or even an entire paragraph. Thanks to the built-in eraser in the lid, changes can be made without leaving the slightest mark or creasing or damaging the paper. It offers clear, legible writing without eraser marks, to do clean work and save a significant amount of time. FriXion's heat sensitive ink technology combines with the convenience of a precise, smooth Pilot fineliner that glides on paper. Its sturdy polyester tip glides over any type of blade. It does not lose quality over time. This versatile box of markers includes 5 blue markers. The eraser cap raises the temperature of the ink in the paper until it is completely eliminated. As the ink is erasable, we do not recommend its use on official documents. </div> </div> <div class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-options-available\\\">Options Available</h2> <h3>Colour Name</h3> <ul class=\\\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\\\"> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> 2 Blue, 1 Black, 1 Red, 1 Green </span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> blue </span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> Blue x 3 </span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> multicoloured </span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> Black/White </span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> Black/Blue/Red/Green </span></li> </ul> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-twister-action\\\" data-pqv-twister-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-twister\\\" data-target=\\\"#twister-plus-inline-twister,#twister\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B07SLY4NMK\\\"> Browse all available options </a> </span> </div> <div id=\\\"pqv-important-information\\\" data-target=\\\"#importantInformation_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-important-information-heading\\\">Important information</h2> <h3>header_for_buffet</h3> <h2>Disclaimer </h2><p>The price may include environmental recycling fees (EPR) where applicable. These fees support the collection and recycling of products at end of life. Learn more <a class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/-/en/gp/help/customer/display.html\\\">here </a>. </p> <h3>header_for_buffet</h3> <h2>Your legal guarantee rights </h2><p>Every consumer in the EU benefits from at least 2 years of legal guarantee protection for any consumer good sold in the EU. <a class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/-/en/gp/help/customer/display.html\\\">See More </a>. </p>